# Every text file is LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every system.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files git would otherwise guess at.
*.png binary
*.tga binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary

# A source download (git archive, GitHub's Download ZIP) has no .git: the build reads its commit from this file, which the
# archive fills in (source/OpenTPW/OpenTPW.csproj).
source/OpenTPW/SourceCommit.md export-subst
